[Desktop Entry]
# Hearth Calculator: KDE KCalc with Hearth's colors (hosts/hearth-kde, docs/KDE-APPS.md). GPL; KDE credited in its About.
Name=Calculator
GenericName=Calculator
Comment=Everyday sums, scientific functions and programmer maths
Exec=kcalc
TryExec=kcalc
Icon=hearth-calculator
Type=Application
Categories=Qt;KDE;Utility;Calculator;
Keywords=calculator;calc;maths;math;scientific;programmer;hex;binary;kcalc;
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=org.kde.kcalc
X-Hearth-Based-On=org.kde.kcalc.desktop
